Change Customer Change Customer close Updating the customer will change the account and contact on this work order. Existing notes, assets, and lines stay on the work order; only the customer and contact are updated. Customer ZZAUTOTEST Regression Walk arrow_drop_down Contact ZZAUTOTEST Walker arrow_drop_down Cancel Update Customer
Change Customer IN ["Customer||Customer ZZAUTOTEST Regression Walk arrow_drop_dow|","Contact||Contact ZZAUTOTEST Walker arrow_drop_down|ZZAUTOTEST Walker"]
