Change Asset Change Asset close Switching the asset updates this work order to the selected asset. Work order lines stay as they are and will be associated to the new asset. Asset 2022 Freightliner Em2 106 RW-1 arrow_drop_down Need a different asset? Add it to this customer, then update the work order. Create New Asset Cancel Update Asset
Change Asset IN ["Asset||Asset 2022 Freightliner Em2 106 RW-1 arrow_drop_do|"]
Change Asset btns ["~close","~Create New Asset","Cancel~Cancel","Update Asset~Update Asset"]
